.secrets/

# Plaintext credential dumps — real values belong only in .secrets/*.env
API.txt
/Opensea API.txt

# Defensive: no Solana keypair/wallet JSON is ever committed, wherever one might
# land by accident. The real signers (mainnet wallet-1.json, the devnet-only
# signer) live outside this repo entirely; this is a backstop, not the primary
# control. Token/NFT metadata files are named by id (e.g. 0001.json) and never
# match these patterns.
**/*wallet*.json
**/*keypair*.json
**/*signer*.json
**/id.json
.env
.env.local
*.env
